stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNCONFIGURED
    UNCONFIGURED --> INACTIVE: CONFIGURE
    INACTIVE --> HOMING: START_HOMING
    INACTIVE --> READY: ACTIVATE [homed]
    INACTIVE --> UNCONFIGURED: SHUTDOWN
    HOMING --> READY: HOMING_DONE
