    HOMING --> STOPPING: STOP_REQUEST
    READY --> MOVING: MOTION_START [homed, no fault]
    READY --> INACTIVE: DEACTIVATE
    READY --> HOMING: START_HOMING
    MOVING --> READY: MOTION_DONE
    MOVING --> STOPPING: STOP_REQUEST
    STOPPING --> READY: STOP_DONE
    INACTIVE --> FAULT: FAULT
    READY --> FAULT: FAULT
    MOVING --> FAULT: FAULT
    STOPPING --> FAULT: FAULT
    FAULT --> INACTIVE: CLEAR_FAULT [operator ack, fresh feedback, 0 read failures]
    ESTOP --> INACTIVE: RELEASE_ESTOP [operator, re-home required]
